# Document Source

## Current Source

Until the migration is complete, this repository keeps the current documentation source in `Docs/`.

Current required documents are:

- `Docs/Project_Charter`
- `Docs/Development_Plan`
- `Docs/Brand_Color_Spec`
- `Docs/RepositoryCMS/Master_Design`
- `Docs/RepositoryCMS/Change_History`
- `Docs/ServerSideLogicFramework/Master_Design`
- `Docs/ServerSideLogicFramework/Change_History`

## Future Canonical Source

The future canonical documentation repository is `Adlaire-Docs`.

`Adlaire-Docs` will manage:

- common Adlaire group documents
- project specifications
- project designs
- cross-project `Development_Plan`
- cross-project `Change_History`
- brand policy
- security policy
- data protection policy
- release policy

Cross-project `Change_History` entries must be summarized within 3 to 5 lines per version.

Project details must be referenced from each project document.

## Development And Release Source

The future development source and official release repository is `Adlaire-Ecosystem`.

`Adlaire-Ecosystem` will not split development source and release artifacts into separate repositories.

It will separate them by folder:

```text
Adlaire-Ecosystem/
  Source/
  Release/
  Tools/
  Work/
```

`Source/` is the development source area.

`Release/` is the official release artifact area.

`Tools/` is the build, sync, package, and release-check area.

`Work/` is the temporary work area and must be removed after preservation checks.

`Release/` must not be edited directly.

Release artifacts must be generated or copied from `Source/` through approved tools and checks.
